Create a new file called main.html.
At the top of the page, add a navbar.
The main header of the page should be: Flower Shop
Use an <h1> tag for this title.
On the page, create 1 card (similar to the cards you made in the portfolio website).
Each card must contain:
Flower picture (<img>)
Flower name (<h4>)
Flower price (<h4>)
Flower description (<p>)
Requirements for each card:
Upload a different flower image
Write the flower name
Write the price
Add a short description of the flower
Example of one card structure:

Image of flower
Rose
$10
A beautiful red flower often used for gifts.
